WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.840
Let's go next to why don't we go? There's just&nbsp;
so many people interested in getting on today.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:11.280
It's hard to know where to go. Why don't we go to&nbsp;
Luke from Minnesota next. Luke, you're on the air.&nbsp;

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:21.200
Hello. So I was wondering what you would think of&nbsp;
a potential boycott of the 2020 Olympics in China?&nbsp;

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:24.320
You mean the 2022 Olympics in China?
That's 2022.&nbsp;

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:29.280
Yes, yeah. We talked about this on the bonus&nbsp;
show earlier this week. There's three types&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:33.920
of boycotts that you can do. There can be&nbsp;
a diplomatic boycott where the athletes go,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:38.160
but the country doesn't send representatives.&nbsp;
It's sort of like a diplomatic protest.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:44.400
You can do an athletic boycott where you don't the&nbsp;
country doesn't send any athletes. And then you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:50.400
can also do what's called the boycott lite, which&nbsp;
is diplomats and athletes go. But the diplomats&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:57.280
make statements that are critical of of the&nbsp;
government. I I tend to think that I want the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.280 --> 00:01:04.160
athletes there. And we've had so many examples&nbsp;
of conflict between countries during which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:09.840
athletes still went. And I don't particularly&nbsp;
care about the Olympics, but I think it's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:17.200
a good message to say that the athletic community&nbsp;
is going to compete in a way that is not tied&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:22.960
to politics and let the diplomats do what they&nbsp;
want. So if they want to do a diplomatic boycott,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:26.480
OK, if they want to do boycott lite. But&nbsp;
I would definitely send send the athletes.&nbsp;

00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:30.400
All right. Thank you so much.&nbsp;
That was a very good answer.&nbsp;

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:32.240
All right. Thank you very much. Yeah, that's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:37.600
we'll talk more about that, I think,&nbsp;
as we get closer to that point in time

